{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他怕一味硬撑会把刚找回的温柔磨掉，便想退回安宁里护住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种生活的牵挂做眼前的事，发现这也在替它争取，旧愿反而近了些，心里敞亮起来。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿反而近了些\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没真正来到，他仍会因想到它而高兴，经历过怀疑和疲惫后更珍惜这份高兴。\",\n      \"key\": \"更珍惜这份高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的事即使尽力做好，也未必能让他过上那种不必防备的生活，最后能护住多少仍没把握。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他做眼前的事时，也会留意自己的做法会不会磨掉刚找回的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"真要承受代价时，他还是可能累得想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"承受代价\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他松了口气，仍清楚自己想护住那种生活，不必再反复说服自己向前。\",\n      \"key\": \"松了口气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并、改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想退回安宁护住旧愿的旧反应，再写出眼前行动也能替旧愿争取。R67与前文重复的部分并入，不再单列。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的坚持原则改成结果未必如愿，以及做事时留意是否磨掉温柔，保留行动方式的限制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"让旧愿成为眼前行动的理由，写出责任与依恋能够一起推动他，不再抽象宣布两边已经和解。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不再说那种生活曾实际带给他快乐，而是写他想到尚未实现的生活仍会高兴。经历怀疑和疲惫后更珍惜这份感受，也不因愿望未成就否定它。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R74\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分、具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留尽力也未必实现愿望、最后能护住多少未知，以及未来仍可能因代价疲惫退缩，删去重复的不确定性总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"转为具体取舍\",\n      \"why\": \"眼前行动能替旧愿争取，而做法又不能磨掉温柔；由此保留哪些值得做、哪些不能轻易耗掉的判断，不再写抽象框架。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再反复证明自己该向前，以松口气后仍清楚想护住什么呈现结尾的收束，也解释末尾由放松到清晰的心理变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "23852b5a-05a0-4ba7-a19d-926bc6fcc7a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012243754085Z", "elapsed_seconds": 153.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:25:16.838748+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ad4ef16bd2489f9e82ec3a915ee80f5d17e991da0fa5958cc9a33825b154be63", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012243754085Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "922b96e35f66d87b43c16e0609865136db0ccf7075bde24865a2a3bd59597340"}}}
